# Paraboloid branch: a quadric declares a varying "N" as its 4x3 = 12
# floats; this Paraboloid's "N" supplies one normal (3 floats). gman is
# expected to warn, clamp and keep going rather than read past "N"'s own
# allocation.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.6]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [1] "Kd" [0]
AttributeBegin
	Paraboloid 1 0 1 360 "N" [0 0 1]
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
	Translate 2 0 0
	Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
